# Video Editing / 3D Design PC - Justification

## CPU
The AMD Ryzen 9 7900X was selected because it provides excellent multi-core performance for video editing and 3D rendering.
Its 12 cores and 24 threads are ideal for professional workloads and multitasking.

### Alternative Component
AMD Ryzen 9 7900 offers similar performance with lower power consumption.

### Future Upgrade
AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D would significantly improve rendering and workstation performance.

---

## CPU Cooler
The be quiet! Dark Rock Elite was selected because it provides strong cooling performance with low noise levels.
It is suitable for high-performance Ryzen processors.

### Alternative Component
Noctua NH-D15 chromax.black provides similar premium cooling performance.

### Future Upgrade
Corsair iCUE LINK TITAN 360 RX RGB would improve cooling efficiency during heavy rendering.

---

## Motherboard
The ASRock B650 Steel Legend WiFi motherboard was selected because it supports DDR5 memory and modern Ryzen processors.
It also provides WiFi connectivity and future upgrade support.

### Alternative Component
MSI B650M PROJECT ZERO offers cleaner cable management and modern design.

### Future Upgrade
GIGABYTE B850 AORUS ELITE WIFI7 provides better VRM cooling and next-generation connectivity.

---

## RAM
32GB DDR5 6000MHz memory was selected because it provides enough capacity for editing software and multitasking.
The high frequency improves rendering and preview performance.

### Alternative Component
Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 6000 provides similar performance.

### Future Upgrade
64GB DDR5 memory would improve large project workflows and 3D rendering.

---

## Storage
The WD_BLACK SN7100 2TB SSD was selected because it provides fast read and write speeds for large media files.
It is suitable for professional editing and rendering applications.

### Alternative Component
Samsung 990 PRO offers premium SSD performance and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
4TB Samsung 990 PRO would provide additional high-speed storage for large projects.

---

## GPU
The RTX 5070 AERO OC was selected because it accelerates rendering, video editing, and AI workloads.
Its 12GB VRAM is suitable for modern creative applications.

### Alternative Component
ASUS RTX 5070 DUAL OC provides similar performance at a lower price.

### Future Upgrade
RTX 5070 Ti would improve rendering and GPU acceleration performance.

---

## Power Supply
The Corsair CX750 750W PSU was selected because it provides enough power for workstation components.
It also allows future GPU upgrades.

### Alternative Component
be quiet! SYSTEM POWER 11 offers improved efficiency and quieter operation.

### Future Upgrade
Seasonic Focus GX-750 provides premium efficiency and reliability.

---

## Case
The Chieftec Pro Midi TG case was selected because it provides good airflow and enough space for workstation components.

### Alternative Component
Corsair FRAME 4000D RS ARGB offers improved airflow and modern aesthetics.

### Future Upgrade
HYTE Y40 provides premium airflow and showcase design.

---

## Monitor
The LG 27UP650P-W monitor was selected because of its 4K IPS panel and accurate colors.
It is suitable for video editing and content creation.

### Alternative Component
Dell UltraSharp U2725QE offers higher refresh rate and premium image quality.

### Future Upgrade
Dual-monitor setup would improve productivity and editing workflow.

---

## Keyboard and Mouse
The Logitech MK295 Silent combo was selected because it provides quiet and comfortable operation for long working sessions.

### Alternative Component
Logitech MX Keys S and MX Master 3S provide premium productivity features.

### Future Upgrade
Logitech MX Mechanical and MX Master 3S would improve workflow and comfort.

